  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "They are as large as a human finger and completely white, round at one end and sharp at the other, like a miniature spear.",
        "chapters": [
          222
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "These Gu are as large as a human finger and completely white, round at one end and sharp at the other, like a miniature spear. Bone Spear Gu is only rank one, and it is the foundational Gu of the white bone inheritance in the same role Moonlight Gu holds for Gu Yue clan.",
        "chapters": [
          222
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_moonlight_gu",
          "fac_gu_yue_clan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s prior-life memory adds that after Bai clan found this inheritance, many of its Gu Masters equipped Bone Spear Gu, so it became a characteristic of Bai clan Gu Masters.",
        "chapters": [
          222
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Shang clan city, Tong Ou shop’s elderly has never seen Bone Spear Gu. The narration calls it a special lineage made by Grey Bone Scholar that had never entered the market.",
        "chapters": [
          261
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_grey_bone_scholar"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While pricing the remaining stock Fang Yuan also notes that Bai clan has these Gu too, so selling them is not a unique leak.",
        "chapters": [
          262
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited main-timeline chapter names a living Bai clan Gu Master who equips Bone Spear Gu after that hall scene.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When the Tong Ou elderly tries a lent Bone Spear Gu, he judges that although it is rank one and not easy to raise, its attack power is high and rather unique.",
        "chapters": [
          261
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "That shop trial is the clearest cited activation of the rank one form itself. Spiral Bone Spear Gu is the evolution of Bone Spear Gu, with higher attack power and penetrative force than the rank one form.",
        "chapters": [
          222
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spiral_bone_spear_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A later sale scene repeats that successfully refining Bone Spear Gu produces Spiral Bone Spear Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          262
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing, already rank three, is disappointed the vat holds no rank three attack Gu and treats the rank one and rank two spears as unable to show a rank three Gu Master’s true power.",
        "chapters": [
          222
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_attack_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bone Spear Gu and Spiral Bone Spear Gu both feed on milk. In the inheritance they are kept in a vat fed by a milk spring, a specialty of Bai Gu mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          222
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Without enough milk spring on the road, many of Fang Yuan’s Bone Spear Gu starve; chapter 239 notes heavy losses, and chapter 242 says two-thirds are already dead despite his efforts to feed them.",
        "chapters": [
          239
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
